cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GLASSCAGE: AI Attack Knowledge Graph security assessment platform"
message: "If you use GLASSCAGE in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The GLASSCAGE Authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Shashankt255/glasscage"
url: "https://github.com/Shashankt255/glasscage"
abstract: >
  GLASSCAGE is a zero-dependency security assessment platform for LLM and agentic
  applications. It builds an AI Attack Knowledge Graph from probe evidence and derives
  attack paths, trust-boundary analysis, blast radius, coverage, remediation, and
  evidence-gated narratives. Findings are hypotheses requiring confirmation; efficacy
  has not been independently validated as of this release.
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0rc4
date-released: 2026-11-05
keywords:
  - LLM security
  - AI red teaming
  - prompt injection
  - attack graph
  - OWASP LLM Top 10
